<h2><?php _e('How to Edit Project Content Using Only Your Keyboard', 'avpvh-print-website');?></h2>
<p><?php _e('Use <b>tab</b> key to focus on the searchbox, other buttons, and the project items. ', 'avpvh-print-website');?></p>
<p><?php _e('Once a project item has focus, press <b>spacebar</b> to toggle selecting it. Select more items in the same way.', 'avpvh-print-website');?></p>
<p><?php _e('Once items are selected, press <b>enter</b> to add them to the project\'s body.', 'avpvh-print-website');?></p>
<p><?php _e('Press <b>up</b> or <b>down</b> keys to move the selected items up or down in the project.', 'avpvh-print-website');?></p>
<p><?php _e('Press escape to unselect everything.', 'avpvh-print-website');?></p>
